<title>GERMANY: Pan-German final Jan cpi inflation +1.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pan-German final Jan cpi inflation +1.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN CPI INFLATION		 Jan 97	Dec 96     Jan 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 +0.5	  +0.3	 +0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)		 +1.8	  +1.4	 +1.5</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    117.6	 117	  115.5</p>
<p> FINAL WEST GERMAN CPI INFLATION  Jan 97	Dec 96     Jan 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 +0.5(+0.4)  +0.3	 +0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)		 +1.9(+1.8)  +1.4	 +1.4</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    115.2(n/a)  114.6	113.1</p>
<p> EAST GERMAN CPI INFLATION	 Jan 97	 Dec 96     Jan 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 +0.7	  +0.1	 +0.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year			    +1.7	  +1.6	 +2.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    136.9	 136.0	134.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Previously announced data in brackets.  </p>
<p>The Office gave the following details:</p>
<p>					    Mth/mth	     Yr/yr</p>
<p>					Jan 97  Dec 96    Jan 97  Dec 96</p>
<p> Food, drink, tobacco	     +0.9    +0.1	+1.5    +1.1</p>
<p> Clothing, shoes		    -0.2    unch	+0.6    +0.8</p>
<p> Rents &amp; energy		     +0.8    +0.2	+3.2    +2.1</p>
<p> Of which: rents		    +0.6    +0.2	+2.8    +2.7</p>
<p>	     energy excl. fuel    +1.5    +0.5	+4.8    -0.1</p>
<p> Furniture, household goods     unch    unch	+0.5    +0.6</p>
<p> Health and body care goods     +0.1    unch	+1.8    +2.1</p>
<p> Traffic and news transmission  +0.3    -0.1	+1.0    +1.6</p>
<p> Education, leisure goods	 +1.9    +0.3	+2.7    +0.7</p>
<p> Personal equipment, others     -1.2    +2.2	+1.3    +1.2</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
